From cf01afe603f3bca876f2059fbe0659444dea6208 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 13:44:43 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(agent): type navigation so content hits cannot fake
 container identity

Search-result evidence is no longer treated as a safe source_container open.
Wrong settles become NAVIGATION_MISMATCH, invalidate that path, and block
reveal until the required container is verified.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
